iSplitUnavailable":"暫無可用的自定義 AI 拆分功能","epub.commands.standalonePluginLabel":"獨立 EPUB 外掛","epub.dataManagement.title":"EPUB 資料管理","epub.displayMode.adaptive.label":"跟隨位置","epub.displayMode.adaptive.description":"側邊欄列表，內容區卡片。","epub.displayMode.list.label":"列表詳情","epub.displayMode.list.description":"突出標題、作者、標籤和進度。","epub.displayMode.grid.label":"卡片網格","epub.displayMode.grid.description":"顯示封面與關鍵資訊。","epub.displayMode.covers.label":"僅看封面","epub.displayMode.covers.description":"切換到純封面書牆。","epub.premium.defaultTitle":"高階功能預覽","epub.premium.defaultDescription":"該能力屬於高階功能，啟用後即可直接使用。","epub.premium.freeColumnTitle":"基礎免費功能","epub.premium.premiumColumnTitle":"高階付費功能","epub.premium.continueBasicReading":"繼續基礎閱讀","epub.premium.limitedTimeOpenSuffix":" (限時開放)","epub.premium.lockedFormatNotice":"{format} 閱讀是高階功能，請啟用許可證後使用","epub.premium.freeFeatures.basicReading.title":"EPUB、TXT 與 FB2 基礎閱讀","epub.premium.freeFeatures.basicReading.description":"免費開啟 EPUB、TXT、FB2/FBZ 書籍，支援正文閱讀、章節切換與目錄跳轉（TXT 按段落分章）。","epub.premium.freeFeatures.bookmarksAndNavigation.title":"書籤與閱讀進度","epub.premium.freeFeatures.bookmarksAndNavigation.description":"免費使用書籍資料目錄、當前頁書籤、書籤列表跳轉，以及閱讀位置儲存恢復、書架進度展示與連續閱讀自動儲存。","epub.premium.freeFeatures.incrementalReadingEntry.title":"增量閱讀入口","epub.premium.freeFeatures.incrementalReadingEntry.description":"目錄中可將章節加入增量閱讀（需安裝增量閱讀外掛，當前為基礎免費入口）。","epub.premium.freeFeatures.typographyAndView.title":"閱讀排版與檢視","epub.premium.freeFeatures.typographyAndView.description":"免費調整閱讀佈局、排版引數與連續滾動側邊翻頁鍵。","epub.premium.freeFeatures.aiAndTutorial.title":"AI 與教程入口","epub.premium.freeFeatures.aiAndTutorial.description":"免費使用選中文字搜尋、AI 面板和閱讀器教程。","epub.premium.freeFeatures.cardCreation.title":"摘錄制卡","epub.premium.freeFeatures.cardCreation.description":"免費將當前選區或摘錄內容填充到記憶卡片建立視窗。","epub.premium.freeFeatures.excerptNotes.title":"摘錄與想法","epub.premium.freeFeatures.excerptNotes.description":"免費使用高亮、想法、摘錄時間戳、截圖工具與儲存圖片檔案。","epub.premium.freeFeatures.chapterExport.title":"匯出當前章為 Markdown","epub.premium.freeFeatures.chapterExport.description":"免費將當前章節正文匯出為 Markdown 檔案，便於繼續整理。","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.nonEpubFormats.title":"擴充套件格式閱讀","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.nonEpubFormats.description":"解鎖 MOBI、AZW3、CBZ 等擴充套件格式（EPUB、TXT、FB2/FBZ 免費）。","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.readingReference.title":"參考閱讀點與頂部貼紙","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.readingReference.description":"手動記錄參考閱讀位置，並在閱讀器頂部展示可配置的貼紙提示。","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.paragraphMode.title":"段落閱讀模式","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.paragraphMode.description":"進入沉浸式單段閱讀介面，支援段落聚焦、字號微調、段內翻屏和跨段切換。","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.immersiveFullscreen.title":"沉浸式全螢幕","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.immersiveFullscreen.description":"進入全螢幕閱讀，隱藏 Obsidian 介面邊框，專注正文；可隨時退出。","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.sourceLocation.title":"雙向溯源定位","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.sourceLocation.description":"在閱讀器與筆記、Canvas、卡片之間按摘錄連結精確定位；適用於 EPUB、MOBI、TXT、CBZ 等所有支援格式，未啟用許可證時不可用。","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.footnotePreview.title":"腳註浮窗預覽","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.footnotePreview.description":"點選腳註序號直接顯示浮窗預覽，而不是僅跳轉原文。","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.chapterExport.title":"高階匯出 Markdown","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.chapterExport.description":"匯出本書或當前章摘錄筆記，以及帶摘錄標記的章節 Markdown。","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.vocabulary.title":"詞彙表學習","epub.premium.premiumFeatures.vocabulary.description":"側欄詞彙佇列、正文生詞標註、選區加入生詞本，並與 Weave 生詞複習同步。","epub.bottomNav.prevPage":"上一頁","epub.bottomNav.nextPage":"下一頁","epub.bottomNav.pageStatus":"第 {current} / {total} 頁","epub.bottomNav.locating":"正在定位頁碼…","epub.bottomNav.jumpLabel":"跳轉頁數","epub.bottomNav.jumpAction":"跳轉","epub.bookmarks.loading":"正在載入書籤…","epub.bookmarks.empty":"暫無書籤","epub.bookmarks.hint":"點選閱讀器頂部書籤按鈕即可儲存當前位置","epub.bookmarks.goto":"跳轉到 {chapter}","epub.bookmarks.delete":"刪除書籤","epub.bookmarks.deleteWithChapter":"刪除書籤 {chapter}","epub.notes.loading":"正在載入摘錄…","epub.notes.preparing":"正在準備摘錄索引…","epub.notes.syncing":"正在同步摘錄…","epub.notes.empty":"暫時還沒有摘錄，閱讀時選中文字後就可以在這裡回看。","epub.notes.noMatches":"沒有匹配的摘錄，請嘗試調