本次遷移僅升級「閱讀進度與書籤」的儲存檔案版式，不會修改你在 vault 其他位置的摘錄、高亮與閱讀筆記。

確認後將先自動備份到外掛目錄，然後立即開始升級。`,"epub.migration.bookmarkDataPage.promptConfirm":"確認並開始遷移","epub.migration.bookmarkDataPage.promptCancel":"稍後","epub.migration.bookmarkDataPage.success":"已升級 {count} 個書籍資料頁。備份已儲存（ID：{backupId}）。","epub.migration.bookmarkDataPage.failed":"書籍資料頁遷移失敗。如需恢復，可使用外掛目錄 backups/epub-bookmarks 中的備份檔案。","epub.migration.bookmarkFolder.legacyMigrated":"已將 {count} 個書籍資料檔案遷移到新預設目錄：{folder}","epub.migration.bookmarkFolder.legacyFailed":"舊預設書籍資料目錄遷移失敗，請在設定中手動更改目錄。","epub.migration.exportTemplateFolder.legacyMigrated":"已將 {count} 個匯出模板檔案遷移到新預設目錄：{folder}","epub.migration.exportTemplateFolder.legacyFailed":"舊預設匯出模板目錄遷移失敗，請在設定中手動更改目錄。","epub.settings.tabs.basic":"基礎","epub.settings.tabs.vocabulary":"詞彙","epub.settings.tabs.license":"授權","epub.settings.tabs.about":"關於","epub.settings.contact.email":"郵箱反饋","epub.settings.contact.docs":"教程文件","epub.settings.contact.changelog":"更新日誌","epub.settings.contact.community":"反饋群","epub.settings.about.supportedFormats":"支援格式","epub.settings.about.overview":"核心介紹","epub.settings.about.overviewValue":"支援高亮摘錄、EPUB 雙向溯源、Markdown 匯出、閱讀進度記錄，並可聯動 Weave 進行增量閱讀與知識整理。","epub.settings.about.panelTitle":"外掛資訊與能力概覽","epub.settings.about.panelDescription":"集中檢視當前閱讀器的基礎資訊、支援格式與核心能力。","epub.settings.about.pluginInfo":"外掛資訊","epub.settings.about.pluginName":"外掛名","epub.settings.about.version":"版本號","epub.settings.about.series":"系列歸屬","epub.settings.about.platform":"支援平臺","epub.settings.about.platformValue":"Obsidian 全平臺","epub.settings.about.licensedDevices":"授權裝置數量","epub.settings.about.licensedDevicesValue":"5 臺裝置","epub.settings.about.readingOverview":"閱讀能力概覽","epub.settings.about.contactTitle":"聯絡方式","epub.settings.groups.interface":"介面","epub.settings.groups.premiumPreview":"高階預覽","epub.settings.groups.reading":"閱讀位置與書籤","epub.settings.groups.features":"功能入口與摘錄","epub.settings.groups.diagnostics":"開發與診斷","epub.settings.notifications.bookmarkFolderUpdated":"書籍資料目錄已更新","epub.settings.notifications.bookmarkFolderRelocated":"已遷移 {count} 個書