確認後立即遷移；目標位置已存在的同名檔案會跳過。`,"epub.settings.basic.bookmarkFolderConfirm":"確認並遷移","epub.settings.basic.bookmarkFolderCancel":"取消","epub.settings.basic.bookNotesExportTemplateFolder":"匯出模板目錄","epub.settings.basic.bookNotesExportTemplateFolderDesc":"匯出摘錄筆記時，模板檔案只從該資料夾中檢索與選擇。","epub.settings.basic.bookNotesExportTemplateFolderPlaceholder":"選擇模板資料夾路徑","epub.settings.basic.bookshelfDisplayMode":"我的書架預設顯示模式","epub.settings.basic.bookshelfDisplayModeDesc":"可在跟隨位置、列表詳情、卡片網格、僅看封面之間切換，頂部多功能選單會同步使用這套模式。","epub.settings.basic.autoSaveReadingPosition":"自動記錄閱讀位置","epub.settings.basic.autoSaveReadingPositionDesc":"連續閱讀達到設定頁數後自動儲存當前位置；關閉閱讀器或切換書籍時仍會儲存最後位置。","epub.settings.basic.autoSavePages":"連續閱讀頁數","epub.settings.basic.autoSavePagesDesc":"達到該頁數時自動記錄一次閱讀位置。範圍 {min}-{max} 頁，預設 {default} 頁。","epub.settings.basic.exportTemplate":"匯出筆記模板","epub.settings.basic.exportTemplateDesc":"管理摘錄筆記匯出模板，支援編輯、預覽與設為預設。","epub.settings.basic.defaultExportTemplate":"預設模板：{name}","epub.settings.basic.debugMode":"除錯模式","epub.settings.basic.debugModeDesc":"開啟後會輸出更完整的除錯日誌，便於排查腳註預覽、閱讀器渲染與熱過載問題。","epub.settings.basic.rebuildHighlightIndex":"重建 EPUB 摘錄索引","epub.settings.basic.rebuildHighlightIndexDesc":"刪除外掛目錄中的摘錄快取與來源索引後，在下次開啟書籍時後臺重建。不會刪除筆記、Canvas 或 .wdeck 中的卡片正文。","epub.settings.basic.rebuildHighlightIndexSuccess":"摘錄索引快取已清除，下次開啟書籍時將重新建立。","epub.settings.basic.rebuildHighlightIndexFailed":"清除摘錄索引快取失敗，請檢視控制檯日誌。","epub.settings.basic.sourceNavigationOpenInNewTab":"溯源跳轉時在新標籤頁開啟筆記","epub.settings.basic.sourceNavigationOpenInNewTabDesc":"從閱讀器跳轉到 Markdown、Canvas 或 JSON 來源時，優先複用已開啟的標籤頁；關閉後會在新標籤頁開啟，便於與當前書籍並排閱讀。","epub.settings.exportTemplateModal.title":"匯出筆記模板","epub.settings.exportTemplateModal.templateSelect":"模板檔案","epub.settings.exportTemplateModal.parametersTitle":"模板引數","epub.settings.exportTemplateModal.createFromPreset":"從預設建立","epub.settings.exportTemplateModal.pageLabelNote":"頁碼優先使用閱讀器解析出的書籍頁碼；若 EPUB 不含 page-list，頁碼欄位可能為空。","epub.settings.exportTemplateModal.save":"儲存","epub.settings.exportTemplateModal.set